<title>USA: U.S. aluminum stocks lower in March - ABMS.</title>
<headline>U.S. aluminum stocks lower in March - ABMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total U.S. aluminum stocks held by integrated and non-integrated producers and smelters including scrap, ingot, metal in-process and finished products fell to 1,995,000 short tons in March from 2,020,000 short tons in February, said American Bureau of Metal Statistics.</p>
<p>Primary Production rose to 338,000 short tons in March compared with 305,000 short tons for February.</p>
<p>Net shipments were 852,000 short tons in March versus 791,000 short tons in the previous month.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640</p>
